    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "*** BER details to follow ***\r\n\r\nA truly exceptional family home, No. 99 Terenure Road West is a distinguished circa 1930`s five-bedroom semi-detached residence occupying a prime position along one of Terenure`s most sought-after and established residential roads. Lovingly maintained by the same family for many years, this impressive home offers a rare opportunity to acquire a substantial property of immense character and charm, with outstanding potential to create a forever family home for generations to come.\r\n\r\nBeyond its beautiful façade, the accommodation extends to generously proportioned rooms synonymous with homes of this era. A welcoming entrance porch opens to a gracious reception hall with guest WC, setting the tone for the elegant accommodation that follows. The property retains a wealth of original period features including beautiful fireplaces, pocket doors, decorative coving, picture rails, original internal doors and a stunning curved bay window, all combining to create a home of warmth, character and timeless appeal.\r\n\r\nThe ground floor comprises three elegant reception rooms, a living room, a family room, breakfast/dining room and kitchen, providing excellent living and entertaining space for modern family life. Upstairs, there are five well-proportioned bedrooms together with a shower room and separate WC. The original garage remains intact and offers excellent potential for conversion, subject to the necessary planning permission.\r\n\r\nWhile the property has been lovingly cared for and is perfectly habitable in its current condition, it now offers an exciting opportunity for the next owners to modernise and enhance the accommodation to suit their own tastes and requirements. The generous proportions, intact period features and outstanding site combine to create a home of exceptional potential.\r\n\r\nA particular feature of No. 99 is the magnificent rear garden extending to approximately 100ft in length. Wonderfully private and beautifully stocked with mature planting, shrubs and trees, it provides a tranquil oasis rarely found so close to the city. To the front, a large gravel driveway provides ample off-street parking for three to four cars and is screened by mature hedging and planting, creating a wonderful sense of privacy and seclusion. A gated side entrance provides convenient access to the rear garden.\r\n\r\nThe location needs little introduction. Terenure Road West is regarded as one of Dublin`s premier family addresses, enjoying exceptional convenience, with an excellent choice of well-established junior and senior schools all within easy walking distance to include Our Lady`s, Presentation, Templeogue College, Terenure College and St Pius X. Terenure Village is only moments away, offering a vibrant array of restaurants, cafés, bars, and boutique shops. Excellent public transport links offer swift access to the city centre, while the M50 is just minutes away. For outdoor enthusiasts, both Bushy Park and Rathfarnham Castle & Park are within close proximity, providing wonderful open spaces for leisure and recreation. In addition, Dundrum Town Centre, as well as the nearby villages of Rathfarnham and Templeogue, are easily accessible, ensuring an abundance of amenities all within a short drive.\r\n\r\nHomes of this calibre, with such wonderful period character, generous accommodation and exceptional gardens, rarely come to the market. No. 99 represents a unique opportunity to acquire a substantial family residence in one of Dublin`s most desirable and enduringly popular locations."
      },
